<div class="container mx-auto px-8 py-8 max-w-7xl">
  
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-black uppercase mb-2">Headers & Navigation</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600">TitleBox und Project Header Komponenten</p>
  </div>

  <!-- View switch: the views of ONE page (NeoViewSwitchComponent) -->
  <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg bg-white p-8 mb-8 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      <i class="bi bi-layout-split text-cobalt-500"></i>
      NeoViewSwitchComponent
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
      Umschalter zwischen den <strong>Ansichten einer Seite</strong> (Tickets: Tabelle | Kanban, Zeiten: Übersicht | Liste).
      Zwei Formen: die <strong>Rinne</strong> (zwei bis vier Segmente in einer versenkten Mulde, die aktive
      Stellung als helles Plättchen) für drei bis fünf gleichrangige Stellungen, die oft gewechselt werden;
      das <strong>Symbolpaar</strong> (<code class="px-1 bg-gray-100 rounded">variant: :icon_pair</code>, zwei Flächen
      30 × 30 ohne Behälter, aktiv im Hover-Ton der Nebenaktionen, nie im Auswahl-Ton) für zwei seltene Stellungen
      wie Liste | Kanban. Das Symbol ist die sichtbare Beschriftung, der Titel wird vorgelesen und erscheint beim
      Paar auch bei Tastaturfokus.
      Links (<code class="px-1 bg-gray-100 rounded">method: :get</code>) navigieren per Adresse und tragen
      <code class="px-1 bg-gray-100 rounded">aria-current</code>; andere Methoden rendern ein <code class="px-1 bg-gray-100 rounded">button_to</code>-Formular
      (eine Einstellung, die der Server speichert).
      Nicht für Filter (Checkbox-Pillen) und nicht für Einstellungen in Formularen (NeoSegmentedRadioComponent).
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded border">
      <%= render NeoViewSwitchComponent.new(
        label: 'Ansicht',
        items: [
          { key: :overview, icon: 'bi-bar-chart', title: 'Übersicht', active: true, path: '#' },
          { key: :list, icon: 'bi-list-ul', title: 'Liste', active: false, path: '#' }
        ]
      ) %>
      <%= render NeoViewSwitchComponent.new(
        label: 'Ansicht',
        items: [
          { key: :table, icon: 'bi-table', title: 'Tabelle', active: false, path: '#' },
          { key: :kanban, icon: 'bi-kanban', title: 'Kanban', active: true, path: '#' }
        ]
      ) %>
      <%# The icon pair (designer, 09.09.2026): the tickets' switch. %>
      <%= render NeoViewSwitchComponent.new(
        label: 'Ansicht',
        variant: :icon_pair,
        items: [
          { key: :table, icon: :list, title: 'Liste', active: true, path: '#' },
          { key: :kanban, icon: :kanban, title: 'Kanban', active: false, path: '#' }
        ]
      ) %>
    </div>
    <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded overflow-x-auto text-sm mt-4"><code>&lt;%= render NeoViewSwitchComponent.new(
  label: t('views.organisations.time_sessions.index.view_switch_label'),
  items: [
    { key: :overview, icon: 'bi-bar-chart', title: t('...view_overview'), active: @view == 'overview', path: time_list_path(org, view: 'overview') },
    { key: :list,     icon: 'bi-list-ul',  title: t('...view_list'),     active: @view == 'list',     path: time_list_path(org) }
  ]
) %&gt;</code></pre>
  </div>

  <!-- Project Navigation Component -->
  <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-8 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">NeoProjectNavigationComponent</h2>
    
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-left clear-both">Live Beispiel</h3>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-black rounded-lg p-4 overflow-hidden">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Beispiel Navigation (funktionale Links deaktiviert für Demo):</p>
        <div class="flex overflow-x-auto gap-8">
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">Dashboard</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">GPT</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-black">Tasks</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">Notizen</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">Dateien</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">Zeiten</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">Team</span>
          <span class="pt-0 pb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-400">Smart Folders</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded overflow-x-auto text-sm"><code>&lt;%= render NeoProjectNavigationComponent.new(
  project: @project,
  current_tab: :tasks # optional, auto-detect
) %&gt;</code></pre>
    
    <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-cobalt-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Features</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>• <strong>Auto-Detection:</strong> Erkennt aktiven Tab automatisch</li>
          <li>• <strong>Permissions:</strong> Zeigt nur verfügbare Bereiche</li>
          <li>• <strong>Responsive:</strong> Horizontal scrollbar bei Bedarf</li>
          <li>• <strong>Customizable:</strong> Override für current_tab</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-green-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Parameters</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>• <strong>project:</strong> Project-Objekt (erforderlich)</li>
          <li>• <strong>current_tab:</strong> Symbol für aktiven Tab (optional)</li>
          <li>• Automatische Berechtigung-Prüfung</li>
          <li>• Session-basierte Parameter-Behandlung</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TitleBox Component -->
  <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-8 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">NeoTitleBoxComponent</h2>
    
    <!-- Project Variant -->
    <div class="mb-8 clear-both">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-left clear-both">Project Variant (Blue)</h3>
      <div class="mb-4 relative">
        <%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
          title: "Beispiel Projekt",
          subtitle: "My Project",
          badge: "Intelligenter Ordner",
          variant: :project
        ) do |c| %>
          <% c.with_center_content do %>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded justify-start">
              <button class="h-8 py-2 px-3 relative inline-flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-x-2 text-sm tracking-[.00714em] font-medium border border-black hover:bg-gray-100 cursor-pointer rounded-l" style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);">
                <i class="bi bi-funnel text-sm"></i>
              </button>
              <button class="h-8 py-2 px-3 relative inline-flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-x-2 text-sm tracking-[.00714em] font-medium border border-black hover:bg-gray-100 cursor-pointer -ml-[1px]" style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);">
                <i class="bi bi-list text-sm"></i>
              </button>
              <button class="h-8 py-2 px-3 relative inline-flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-x-2 text-sm tracking-[.00714em] font-medium border border-black hover:bg-gray-100 cursor-pointer -ml-[1px] rounded-r" style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);">
                <i class="bi bi-file-text text-sm"></i>
              </button>
            </div>
          <% end %>
          
          <% c.with_right_content do %>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <input type="search" placeholder="Suche..." class="h-10 leading-5 relative text-sm py-2 px-4 border border-black rounded bg-white/60 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
              <%= render Neo::Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(variant: :primary, size: :medium, icon: "plus-lg") do %>
                Neu
              <% end %>
              <%= render Neo::Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(variant: :secondary, size: :medium, icon: "chat-text") do %>
                Chat
              <% end %>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded p-4 bg-gray-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Code</h4>
        <pre class="text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code>&lt;%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
  title: "Beispiel Projekt",
  subtitle: "My Project", 
  badge: "Intelligenter Ordner",
  variant: :project
) do |c| %&gt;
  &lt;% c.with_center_content do %&gt;
    &lt;!-- Toggle Controls --&gt;
  &lt;% end %&gt;
  
  &lt;% c.with_right_content do %&gt;
    &lt;!-- Actions --&gt;
  &lt;% end %&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Organisation Variant -->
    <div class="mb-8 clear-both">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-left clear-both">Organisation Variant (Red)</h3>
      <div class="mb-4 relative">
        <%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
          title: "Organisation Settings",
          subtitle: "My Organisation",
          variant: :organisation
        ) do |c| %>
          <% c.with_right_content do %>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <%= render Neo::Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(variant: :primary, size: :medium, icon: "gear") do %>
                Einstellungen
              <% end %>
              <%= render Neo::Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(variant: :danger, size: :medium, icon: "trash") do %>
                Löschen
              <% end %>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded p-4 bg-gray-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Code</h4>
        <pre class="text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code>&lt;%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
  title: "Organisation Settings",
  subtitle: "My Organisation",
  variant: :organisation
) do |c| %&gt;
  &lt;% c.with_right_content do %&gt;
    &lt;!-- Only right actions, no center content --&gt;
  &lt;% end %&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Simple Title Only -->
    <div class="mb-8 clear-both">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-left clear-both">Simple Title Only</h3>
      <div class="mb-4 relative">
        <%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
          title: "Einfacher Titel",
          variant: :project
        ) %>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded p-4 bg-gray-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Code</h4>
        <pre class="text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code>&lt;%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
  title: "Einfacher Titel",
  variant: :project
) %&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Features -->
  <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-8 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Features & Slots</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-cobalt-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Intelligent Layout</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>• <strong>Mit Center Content:</strong> 3-Spalten Grid Layout</li>
          <li>• <strong>Ohne Center Content:</strong> 2-Spalten Flex Layout</li>
          <li>• Automatische Erkennung und Anpassung</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-green-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Flexible Slots</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>• <strong>center_content:</strong> Toggle Controls (Mitte)</li>
          <li>• <strong>right_content:</strong> Actions (Rechts)</li>
          <li>• <strong>Fallback:</strong> Content als right_content</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-yellow-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Variants</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>• <strong>:project</strong> - Standard für Projekt-Seiten (Unterzeile via subtitle:)</li>
          <li>• <strong>:organisation</strong> - Unterzeile fällt ohne subtitle: auf den Org-Namen zurück</li>
          <li>• Erweiterbar für weitere Kontexte</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-purple-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Customization</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>• <strong>title:</strong> Haupttitel (erforderlich) — Groß-/Kleinschreibung, keine Versalien</li>
          <li>• <strong>subtitle:</strong> Kontext-Unterzeile, gestapelt unter dem Titel (klein, gedämpft)</li>
          <li>• <strong>badge:</strong> Kleiner Badge rechts vom Titel</li>
          <li>• <strong>Spacing:</strong> margin_top/padding_y/margin_bottom optional — Default: kein Offset oben, mb-6 unten</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Best Practices -->
  <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-8 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Best Practices</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-green-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-green-800">Do's ✓</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Verwende center_content für Toggle-Controls</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Verwende right_content für Actions wie Search/Buttons</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Nutze projekt variant für Projekt-bezogene Seiten</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Nutze organisation variant für org-weite Einstellungen</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Verlasse dich auf die Default-Abstände — keine margin-Overrides nötig</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-red-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-red-800">Don'ts ✗</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill text-red-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Verwende keine inline Styles außer für dynamische Werte</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill text-red-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Überfülle nicht die center_content mit zu vielen Elementen</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill text-red-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Mische nicht zu viele unterschiedliche Button-Stile</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill text-red-500 mr-2 mt-0.5"></i>
            <span>Titel nicht in Versalien setzen — Groß-/Kleinschreibung ist der App-Standard</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Layout Guidelines -->
  <div class="border-2 border-black rounded-lg bg-white p-6 mb-8 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#000000]">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Layout Guidelines für Header & Content</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-black rounded-lg p-4 bg-gray-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3">Korrekte Struktur</h3>
        <pre class="text-xs overflow-x-auto bg-white p-3 border border-black rounded"><code>&lt;%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(
  title: "Seitentitel",
  variant: :organisation
) %&gt;

&lt;!-- Content direkt ohne Container --&gt;
&lt;div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"&gt;
  &lt;!-- Cards --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border-2 border-red-500 rounded-lg p-4 bg-red-50">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-red-800">Falsche Struktur ❌</h3>
        <pre class="text-xs overflow-x-auto bg-white p-3 border border-black rounded"><code>&lt;%= render NeoTitleBoxComponent.new(..., margin_top: "-mt-8") %&gt;

&lt;!-- NICHT: margin-Kompensation + Container um Content --&gt;
&lt;div class="container mx-auto px-4 mt-8"&gt;
  &lt;div class="grid ..."&gt;
    &lt;!-- Cards --&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-cobalt-50 border border-cobalt-300 rounded-lg">
      <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Wichtige Regeln</h3>
      <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
        <li>• <strong>Kein Wrapper-Offset:</strong> Die TitleBox sitzt ohne Zusatz-Padding bündig oben (Layout liefert den Grundabstand)</li>
        <li>• <strong>TitleBox:</strong> Ohne margin-Overrides rendern — die Defaults SIND der Standard-Abstand</li>
        <li>• <strong>Content:</strong> Direkt unter Header platzieren, OHNE Container-Wrapper</li>
        <li>• <strong>Abstand zum Header:</strong> Liefert die TitleBox selbst (mb-6) — kein zusätzliches mt-8 am Content</li>
        <li>• <strong>Bündigkeit:</strong> Header und Content sind dadurch perfekt bündig</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="border border-green-500 rounded-lg p-4 bg-green-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2 text-green-800">✓ Richtig: Bündige Ausrichtung</h4>
        <div class="bg-white border border-black rounded p-2 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-300 to-orange-300 border border-black rounded p-2 mb-2">Header (full width)</div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <div class="bg-gray-200 border border-black rounded p-2 flex-1">Card</div>
            <div class="bg-gray-200 border border-black rounded p-2 flex-1">Card</div>
            <div class="bg-gray-200 border border-black rounded p-2 flex-1">Card</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-red-500 rounded-lg p-4 bg-red-50">
        <h4 class="font-bold mb-2 text-red-800">✗ Falsch: Mit Container</h4>
        <div class="bg-white border border-black rounded p-2 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-300 to-orange-300 border border-black rounded p-2 mb-2">Header (full width)</div>
          <div class="px-4">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <div class="bg-gray-200 border border-black rounded p-2 flex-1">Card</div>
              <div class="bg-gray-200 border border-black rounded p-2 flex-1">Card</div>
              <div class="bg-gray-200 border border-black rounded p-2 flex-1">Card</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>